Hello everyone
How can we prevent violation of assumtion of certain detection on the line of transect for noctural mammal like flying squirrels and slow loris
I was intending to implement Mark Recapture Distance Sampling method for this with one observer team walking 20 mins later then the previous team

On Fri, 31 Jul 2020, 5:33 am Cicero Simão <cicinh...@gmail.com wrote:

> Hello
> I am doing a population density work of Crypturellus noctivagus, I travel a 3.3 km transect, but I am having a problem in the analysis because the shortest detection distance is 100 meters, the species is very skittish and does not approach the transect, there is any R package for cases like mine or to ease this false negativity in detection?
> Thank you very much
