> If snapshots occur at pre-determined times, independent of whether animals are present, then there should be no bias.  But if a sensor is used that triggers when an animal is detected, there will be bias in recorded animal locations.  If the time between snapshots is taken to be very small, for example 2 seconds, this bias will be small.
